msgstr "如需了解更多详情，请查阅 link:https://github.com/grpc/grpc/blob/v1.28.1/doc/health-checking.md[gRPC 文档]"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Additionally, if Quarkus SmallRye Health is added to the application, a readiness check for\n"
